flowchart TD
    A[Game selected] --> B[Load GameProfiles]
    B --> C[Refresh Hardware / Display / Input evidence]
    C --> D{Explicit profile selected?}

    D -- Yes --> E[Evaluate selected profile]
    E --> F{Eligible?}
    F -- Exact --> R[Create ResolvedProfileContext]
    F -- Approved fallback --> G{Fallback material?}
    G -- No --> R
    G -- Yes --> H[User confirms fallback]
    H --> R
    F -- No --> I[Offer compatible alternatives]

    D -- No --> J[Evaluate all profiles]
    J --> K[Exact same-context preference]
    K --> L{Found unique eligible?}
    L -- Yes --> R
    L -- No --> M[Last-used same scenario]
    M --> N{Found eligible?}
    N -- Yes --> R
    N -- No --> O[Game default profile]
    O --> P{Eligible?}
    P -- Yes --> R
    P -- No --> Q{Unique remaining eligible?}
    Q -- Yes --> R
    Q -- No --> I

    R --> S[Bind profile revision + snapshot generations]
    S --> T[Resolve recommendation]
    T --> U[Before apply validate generations]
    U --> V{Still current?}
    V -- Yes --> W[Continue managed launch]
    V -- No --> C
